    TRAIL LINE x2 :: "Two pairs of eyes, twice the ground. That was the deal, and it is working."
    TRAIL LINE x2 :: "Between us we are carrying 650 kcal. Onward — there is more green ahead."
    TRAIL LINE x2 :: "The pantry is counting on us. Eyes on the ground, ears open."
    TRAIL LINE x1 :: "Slow. The patch gives more when you do not rush it."
    TRAIL LINE x1 :: "Keep together out here. The green is generous; the rest of the wild is not."
    TRAIL LINE x1 :: "Check behind you as you pick. Something that follows is quieter than we are."
