  M4 CANDIDATE [D-talk-request mateo_alvarez turns=11 naturalEnd=true]:
    NPC: "We never did finish talking about the big questions — that was 8 days back. Still on your mind? 'The System gave different things to different people. That's not random — it's matchmaking. It's building a…'"
    NPC: "I've heard good things about Stonebridge. We should link with them — we'd be stronger together."
    YOU: "All right. Let's ask them."
    NPC: "Good — the word on them is kind. Go and ask." You carry the proposal to Stonebridge.
    YOU: "Wait — what were we talking about?"
    NPC: "the big questions — that's still where we are."
    YOU: "Wait — what were we talking about?"
    NPC: "We're going in circles — still on the big questions. Ask me something else if you want."
    YOU: "Can I ask you something else?"
    NPC: "Go ahead — you've got my attention."
    YOU: "How are you holding up — really?"
    NPC: "Good question." "The whole fire was arguing about The Anaconda Empress last night — what to even CALL it. 'Loud-Eyes' got shouted down. What's your vote?"
    YOU: "I need a moment to think about that."
    NPC: "Take your time."
    YOU: "And then?"
    NPC: They take it in and give nothing back. Not yet.
    YOU: "Go on."
    NPC: "I have opinions about the name. I am saving them for when they count."
    YOU: "I’m listening."
    NPC: "We'll land on something. We always do — usually the loudest person's idea."
    YOU: "And then?"
    NPC: "Right. Action time. You know where to find me."
    YOU: "..."
    NPC: A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be.
    NPC: "Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now."
    NPC: They're smiling as you go. "Come back anytime."

